open NumberField IsDedekindDomain Formalism.ConjugateSelfDual ReciprocityTheory.Gal Formalism.MainNotions.N GlobalTheory.GalOfCusp UpperTheory.V UpperTheory.V.Af UpperTheory.V.HV GlobalTheory.Ord2
